--- !u!1001 &1243371558
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Manager1
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: falasGenericas.Array.size
      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasMissao.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Diga o seu nome, rapaz. E fale a verdade, que aqui n\xE3o se tolera
        mentira."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasMissao.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Jos\xE9 Madeira\u2026 Olhe-me nos olhos. Tem jeito de homem de bem.
        Sabe manejar fuzil?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasMissao.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Ent\xE3o est\xE1 aceito. A partir de hoje \xE9s o Soldado Madeira,
        da Companhia de Volunt\xE1rios. Receber\xE1s farda, armamento e ordem de
        marcha."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasMissao.Array.data[3]'
      value: "Que Deus te guarde e que lutemos juntos at\xE9 vermos o Brasil livre
        do jugo portugu\xEAs.\nAssina aqui o termo de alistamento\u2026 e bem-vindo
        \xE0s fileiras da Independ\xEAncia!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasGenericas.Array.data[0]'
      value: "N\xE3o h\xE1 de ser assim, camarada. A sorte ainda nos h\xE1 de sorrir,
        se Deus quiser"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasGenericas.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Destarte, \xE9 preciso ter coragem e n\xE3o fraquejar diante das adversidades."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasGenericas.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Ora bolas! J\xE1 n\xE3o se pode mais viver sob tanto jugo e opress\xE3o!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasGenericas.Array.data[3]'
      value: "Que o diabo carregue os covardes! N\xF3s, homens de bem, havemos de
        lutar at\xE9 o fim"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasGenericas.Array.data[4]'
      value: "Outrossim, conv\xE9m lembrar que a p\xE1tria precisa de bra\xE7os fortes
        e cora\xE7\xF5es leais."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasGenericas.Array.data[5]'
      value: "N\xE3o digas tolices, homem! Isso \xE9 conversa de quem n\xE3o tem
        ju\xEDzo."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasGenericas.Array.data[6]'
      value: "Pela sant\xEDssima liberdade! Prefiro morrer de p\xE9 a viver de joelhos."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasGenericas.Array.data[7]'
      value: "V\xE1 com Deus, e que a fortuna lhe acompanhe nesta jornada"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasGenericas.Array.data[8]'
      value: "J\xE1 chega de tanta injusti\xE7a! \xC9 tempo de erguer a cabe\xE7a
        e reclamar o que \xE9 nosso."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: -4389107628032745758, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'falasGenericas.Array.data[9]'
      value: "Fique certo de uma coisa: enquanto houver um s\xF3 brasileiro de verdade,
        a luta n\xE3o cessar\xE1."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 325999718841856031, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'm_Materials.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 2390e514d2f039848b6fa48699b1586b, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 325999718841856031, guid: 1fa2d55928a98b44aa47f9b6b91dde01, type: 3}
